<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Duke Realty FFO view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Duke Realty FFO view raised.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it raised its funds from operations estimates for Duke Realty Investments Inc to $3.09 a share from $3.06 for 1997 and to $3.40 from $3.32 for 1998.</p>
<p>EVEREN cited management's optimism about the overall health of the real estate market and opportunities for Duke to build new offices and develop warehouses.</p>
<p>Duke shares traded off 1/8 at 41-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
